Assess only evidence that bears on this dispositive question. Check source authority, authenticity, transaction scope, event time, completeness and independent corroboration. Separate supporting from opposing evidence; copied records count once. If the searched partition is incomplete, keep sufficiency unresolved rather than treating absence as proof. Return exact source references and a support, insufficiency or conflict status.
